Subject: [PATCH 17/18] Label every architecture performance table with its
 host

Add the measurement host (2 vCPUs, Intel Xeon @ 2.10GHz, Rust 1.97.0,
CPython 3.12.3) directly above each of the five performance tables, in
addition to the section introduction.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 docs/architecture.md | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/docs/architecture.md b/docs/architecture.md
